---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Work | aksyuma">
	<section class="max-w-2xl">
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 font-mono">
			Work
		</h1>
		<p class="text-zinc-400 text-base leading-relaxed mb-12">
			Career timeline. Employer names anonymised where required by agreement.
		</p>

		<div class="space-y-12">

			<div class="relative pl-6 border-l border-zinc-800">
				<div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></div>
				<p class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 mb-1">2023 – present</p>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 font-mono mb-2">Platform Engineer</h3>
				<p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-3">Enterprise Logistics · Distributed Systems</p>
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
					Designed and operated event-driven data pipelines handling high-throughput write traffic. Built delivery automation, infrastructure-as-code, and operational observability for distributed backend services.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Go</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Kafka</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">AWS</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Kubernetes</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Terraform</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Redis</span>
				</div>
				<a href="/projects/distributed-pipeline" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-mono transition-colors">→ Case Study: Distributed Pipeline</a>
			</div>

			<div class="relative pl-6 border-l border-zinc-800">
				<div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></div>
				<p class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-500 mb-1">2021 – 2023</p>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 font-mono mb-2">Cloud Engineer</h3>
				<p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-3">FinTech · Backend Services</p>
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
					Built and maintained cloud infrastructure on AWS. Implemented CI/CD pipelines, serverless APIs, and messaging integrations. Owned service reliability and incident response for backend microservices.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">AWS</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Lambda</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">DynamoDB</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">GitHub Actions</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Node.js</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="relative pl-6 border-l border-zinc-800">
				<div class="absolute -left-1.5 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></div>
				<p class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-500 mb-1">2019 – 2021</p>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 font-mono mb-2">Software Developer</h3>
				<p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-3">Consulting · Mobile & Cloud</p>
				<p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
					Delivered mobile applications and cloud-connected backends for enterprise clients. Integrated push notifications, messaging services, and identity platforms using AWS.
				</p>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">AWS</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Pinpoint</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">iOS</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Swift</span>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-zinc-800 rounded">Node.js</span>
				</div>
				<a href="https://medium.com/@syumak" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-mono transition-colors">→ Published: AWS Pinpoint tutorials (Medium)</a>
			</div>

		</div>
	</section>
</Base>
